      <h1 data-dc-tpl="23" style="font-family: Newsreader, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(32px, 4.6vw, 58px); line-height: 1.04; letter-spacing: -0.012em; color: rgb(251, 247, 240);">Our first pilot: the Ghor Smart Water Pipeline</h1>
